## File Structure

```
examples/grg_agent/
├── __init__.py              # Exports all public classes
├── config.py                # GRGAgentConfig dataclass
├── state.py                 # Candidate, Score, Strategy, TrajectoryState
├── llm_client.py            # HermesLLMClient (proxy wrapper)
├── llm_skill.py             # LLMSkill (local model wrapper, optional)
├── monitor.py               # GRGMonitor (AlphaMomentumTracker reuse)
├── diversity.py             # DiversityController (prompt/temp variants)
├── planner.py               # CodePlanner (task decomposition)
├── verifier.py              # CodeVerifier (execution, types, tests)
├── agent.py                 # GRGAgent (local model orchestrator)
├── agent_hermes.py          # GRGAgentHermes (proxy-based orchestrator)
├── hermes_skill.py          # GRGAgentSkill (Hermes plugin entry point)
├── skill.yaml               # Skill manifest for Hermes
├── spec.md                  # Technical specification
├── SPEC_HERMES_SKILL.md     # Hermes skill packaging spec
├── test_agent.py            # Local agent integration tests
├── test_hermes.py           # Hermes component tests (mock)
├── test_full_agent.py       # Full agent test with local model
└── README.md                # This file
```

