## Troubleshooting

### "Connection error" on generation
- Hermes proxy not running at `HERMES_PROXY_URL`
- Check: `curl http://localhost:8080/v1/models`
- Set correct proxy: `export HERMES_PROXY_URL=http://your-host:8080/v1`

### No logprobs returned
- Some models/proxies don't support logprobs
- Agent falls back to dummy score (composite=0.5)
- Use model with logprobs support for GRG scoring

### Verification fails
- Check `verify_timeout` (default 10s)
- Complex code may need longer timeout
- Disable with `verify_execution: false` for quick iteration

### Skill not loading in Hermes
- Check `~/.hermes/skills/grg_agent/` exists with `hermes_skill.py`
- Restart Hermes after adding skill
- Check Hermes logs for import errors

---

## Performance Notes

| Metric | Typical Value |
|--------|---------------|
| Iterations to converge | 2-3 |
| Generations per iteration | strategies × candidates_per_strategy |
| Verification rate | ~80% of top candidates |
| GRG composite range | 0.3 - 0.6 (verified code) |
| Diversity (cosine) | 0.3 - 0.7 |
| Total time (mock) | <1s for 3 iterations |
| Total time (real proxy) | Depends on model latency |

